            {
                "entry_id": "947b98bb-2ec5-34e7-89c4-f82ed0aa402d",
                "word": "nativiste",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "126da950-e657-4411-801a-ea3f235f1127",
                        "entry_id": "947b98bb-2ec5-34e7-89c4-f82ed0aa402d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "nativistes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e3078960-b9f4-3f0b-8bcb-cc4504dd53a7",
                        "entry_id": "947b98bb-2ec5-34e7-89c4-f82ed0aa402d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Partisan du nativisme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a710c2d-d385-413c-94f4-465a4a360601",
                                "sense_id": "e3078960-b9f4-3f0b-8bcb-cc4504dd53a7",
                                "text": "La solution donnée par Kant (...) s'est imposée −parfois à leur insu −à la plupart de ceux qui ont de nouveau abordé le problème, nativistes ou empiristes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3ffa9b2b-4281-4d74-8a54-acc60e3d5fff",
                        "source_entry_id": "947b98bb-2ec5-34e7-89c4-f82ed0aa402d",
                        "source_sense_id": "e3078960-b9f4-3f0b-8bcb-cc4504dd53a7",
                        "target_lang_word": "nativist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nativist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "deeefef9-b47c-30d6-bc19-5375165bd487",
                                        "entry_id": "01604338-e2d8-31c2-9660-53403d68c2be",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An advocate of nativism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57877941-427a-406a-888c-059c35ddacd0",
                                                "sense_id": "deeefef9-b47c-30d6-bc19-5375165bd487",
                                                "text": "The growers’ rebellion against E-Verify, and Mr. Smith’s contortions to buy them off, is further proof that the country cannot live without immigrant labor—no matter what the nativists may claim."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5168aec2-9603-4385-8b1d-bda6bfc503ac",
                                                "sense_id": "deeefef9-b47c-30d6-bc19-5375165bd487",
                                                "text": "In short, mainstream parties no longer offer an element that every successful political project requires: a promise of a better world. But nativists still offer it. They solve the problem of climate change by pretending it doesn't exist."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "nativist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f2ef779-7629-3c45-9dd1-42ca889265ba",
                                        "entry_id": "f2794d0a-70bd-3035-bfae-bb8e61004bd9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Related to nativism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f43fc1af-e461-4061-802b-02cdf25c23f0",
                                                "sense_id": "1f2ef779-7629-3c45-9dd1-42ca889265ba",
                                                "text": "When you add the unprecedented engagement of growing numbers of Latino voters in 2008, it becomes clear that the nativist path is the path to permanent political irrelevance. Unless you can find a way to get rid of all the Latinos."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6afab3f-570d-4495-80e0-7f4e1ab777f4",
                                                "sense_id": "1f2ef779-7629-3c45-9dd1-42ca889265ba",
                                                "text": "“I would describe it as isolationist, protectionist and, to a certain extent, nativist,” Mr. Bush said in an interview on NBC’s “Today” show that aired on Tuesday, promoting his new book of paintings and essays honoring immigrants in America."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b8cf7fe-847c-4524-871b-6e7ffb25f10f",
                                                "sense_id": "1f2ef779-7629-3c45-9dd1-42ca889265ba",
                                                "text": "Alchemizing media power into political influence, Mr. Carlson stands in a nativist American tradition that runs from Father Coughlin to Patrick J. Buchanan."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5561e58f-7906-4f14-8476-b9b1ccee7d11",
                                                "sense_id": "1f2ef779-7629-3c45-9dd1-42ca889265ba",
                                                "text": "Most Britons and most elected officials have recoiled at the anti-immigrant violence, indicating that for now, it has hurt the nativist cause more than helped it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
